We found Yagditha's laboratory under the ruins of the fortress. But he appeared suddenly, killing Deykoon and calling his hordes of specters. Yagditha's troops that were not possessed swore loyalty to Zarad and joined the Pristonians. Thanks to Marina's song, I entered Yagditha's mind with Diana for a short time, and the entity revealed itself as Vomori. After an intense battle, I used the Blessing of Idhas to revive our allies. Arteres's arrow opened the way; I entered Yagditha's mind again, cast Vomori out with the Jewel of Life and locked him in the Magic Prison.
The Legendary Trident appeared to Zarad, who defeated Yagditha.
I am glad that the Shogoth have finally been avenged.
I will still need your help; come back in a while.

Receive 5 stat points as a reward for your effort.
